Package: kite-desktop
Version: 1.2.2
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: KiteOS builder <root@localhost>
Depends: xfce4-session, xfwm4, xfce4-panel, xfdesktop4, xfce4-settings, xfconf, thunar, xfce4-terminal,
 xfce4-power-manager, xfce4-power-manager-plugins, xfce4-pulseaudio-plugin, xfce4-docklike-plugin,
 xfce4-notifyd, xfce4-screensaver, exo-utils, xfce4-whiskermenu-plugin, xfce4-appfinder, lightdm, slick-greeter, orchis-gtk-theme,
 papirus-icon-theme, fonts-inter, fonts-jetbrains-mono, x11-xserver-utils, procps, python3, libspa-0.2-bluetooth, kite-system
Recommends: fonts-roboto | fonts-dejavu-core, xfce4-taskmanager, brave-browser, onlyoffice-desktopeditors
Description: KiteOS desktop (windows and mac layouts)
 XFCE in two layouts, chosen at install and switchable with kite-layout:
 "windows" (Fluent theme, Papirus-Light icons, taskbar with a Start menu) and
 "mac" (Qogir theme, menu bar and Dock). The Search key opens the menu. KiteOS
 tray icons, wallpapers, LightDM slick-greeter login screen and artwork.
